{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00543","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 凯安 · 蒋挺","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"维岁之吉，维辰之良。\n圣君绂冕，肃事坛场。\n大礼已备，大乐斯[张]。\n神其醉止，降福无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋挺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}